msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Ryuuji「（Oh wow. The third floor really does＿give off that \"gym pool\" ambience.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Vaya. El tercer piso de verdad＿tiene ese ambiente de \"piscina＿de gimnasio\".）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Maybe I can relax over at the poolside＿lounge area?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Tal vez pueda relajarme en la zona＿de descanso junto a la piscina?）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Is that Kushieda swimming at full＿speed over there......?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Esa de allá es Kushieda nadando＿a toda velocidad......?）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Her form is beautiful. I like to see her＿pushing forward in her own way.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Su estilo es hermoso. Me gusta＿verla avanzar a su manera.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（She's so overflowing with vitality, it's＿like, just watching her energizes me......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Desborda tanta vitalidad que, con solo＿verla, ya me da energía......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Ohh!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Ohh?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（What the!? My heart's beating faster＿all of a sudden......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡¿Pero qué?! Mi corazón late＿más rápido de repente......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（This is...... the way I felt talking to＿Kushieda for the first time......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Esto es...... lo que sentí al hablar＿con Kushieda por primera vez......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（C-Crap! I dropped my thermos!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡R-Rayos! ¡Se me cayó el termo!）」"

msgid "Minori「Takasu-kun?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Takasu-kun?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uhh......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ehh......」"

msgid "Minori「It IS you! What's the matter? Not＿gonna swim?」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Sí eres tú! ¿Qué pasa? ¿No vas a nadar?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「N-Nah. I am still recovering, after all. I＿thought I'd just take it easy for a while.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「N-No. Después de todo, aún me＿estoy recuperando. Pensé en tomármelo＿con calma un rato.」"

msgid "Minori「Oh, that's right. You gots to take care＿of yourself.」"
msgstr "Minori「Ah, claro. Tienes que cuidarte＿como se debe.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Talk"
msgstr "Hablar"

msgid "Don't talk"
msgstr "No hablar"

msgid "Ryuuji「Let's do that, then.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Hagamos eso, entonces.」"

msgid "Minori「With pleasure, sirb!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Con mucho gusto, señorb!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「\"Sirb\"?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿\"Señorb\"?」"

msgid "Minori「Don't mind meeb!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡No me hagas casob!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Sorry. You probably wanted to swim＿some more, huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Perdón. Seguro querías nadar＿un poco más, ¿no?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Okay.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Está bien.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm okay. I'm just clearing my head＿while I have myself some tea.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Estoy bien. Solo despejo la mente＿mientras me tomo un té.」"

msgid "Minori「Oh, you even brought in your own＿thermos. I'd expect no less from you.」"
msgstr "Minori「Oh, hasta trajiste tu propio termo.＿No esperaba menos de ti.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Let me know if you get tired. I'll treat＿you to some of this tea.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Avísame si te cansas. Te invito＿un poco de este té.」"

msgid "Minori「Thanks! Well then, I'mma swim a bit＿more.」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Gracias! Bueno, entonces＿voy a nadar un poco más.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Alright.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「De acuerdo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Maybe it was wrong of me to decline＿after she went out of her way to be＿nice to me.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Tal vez estuvo mal rechazarla＿después de que se molestó en＿ser amable conmigo.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（But right now, I don't think I could talk＿to Kushieda so directly......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Pero ahora mismo, no creo que＿pueda hablar con Kushieda tan＿directamente......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Guess I should sort my feelings out on＿my own.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Supongo que debería aclarar mis＿sentimientos por mi cuenta.）」"

msgid "Minori「But standing around spacing out by＿yourself is no fun, right? Won't you＿have a chat with the great Kushieda」"
msgstr "Minori「Quedarte ahí solo y en las nubes no es＿divertido, ¿no? ¿No quieres charlar con＿la gran Kushieda」"

msgid "Minori「Minori?」"
msgstr "Minori「Minori?」"

msgid "Minori「Taking breaks is important when you＿exercise, bud. Besides, I can always＿swim later. Now, let's get our chat on」"
msgstr "Minori「Hay que descansar al hacer ejercicio,＿amigo. Además, puedo nadar luego.＿¡Ahora, vamos a charlar」"

msgid "Minori「over at the lounge!」"
msgstr "Minori「en el salón!」"
